# MetaHuman Lab's bindings for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS]), as
# coax/web/host.js lays them out: group 0 the frame's uniforms (metahumanlab.coax's 392 floats); group 1
# the scene (the human pack's vertices, the pose store, the pack's layers and their sampler); group 2
# the shadow map. The post pass: bloom_fs's source, sampler and step, and post_fs's light,
# bloom quarter and eighth, aux, depth and sampler (group 1 again: their own pipelines).
u 0 0 uniform 98
vertices 1 0
pose 1 1
sheets 1 2
sheet 1 3
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
bloom_src 1 0
bloom_lin 1 1
bloom_step 1 2 uniform 1
post_light 1 0
post_quarter 1 1
post_eighth 1 2
post_aux 1 3
post_depth 1 4
post_lin 1 5
